{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;(...) and scary stories have been accompanying men for centuries. They have many faces and forms. But what is their purpose? <strong>Why do we enjoy being afraid so much?</strong> During our therapy, I'll try to (...)&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(excerpt from <strong>Dr. Emmerson's Clinic</strong> leaflet)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/extras/d1d6035b2ad8a6e0a121f5cb213f2d1e.avif?t=1770217453\" width=620 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try out our original approach to bringing literature into the interactive medium</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/extras/fac9db1af8ad4e093fc6eeb07176f7e1.webp?t=1770217453\" width=620 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of weird fiction and cosmic horror masterpieces. Experience them in<strong> complete, uncut versions</strong>, created with full respect for their authors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/extras/a4a61cb77f293c9e8531134cb88b0859.avif?t=1770217453\" width=620 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dr. Emmerson's Nocturnes</i> is a collection of <strong>fully-voiced visual novel games in real-time 3D</strong>. If you are interested in the concept, we encourage you to check out our highly acclaimed <strong>completely FREE</strong> adaptation of <strong>Dagon - H. P. Lovecraft's</strong> first story connected to the famous Cthulhu Mythos: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/extras/1a6c736d0d535958d159fa2f62945e36.avif?t=1770217453\" width=460 height=214 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-- <strong>15% of revenue will be donated to charity organizations</strong> --</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(chosen by our community on Discord) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/extras/fac9db1af8ad4e093fc6eeb07176f7e1.webp?t=1770217453\" width=620 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > fully-voiced <strong>narrative experience</strong> in real-time 3D </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>VR </strong>support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>3-4 stories</strong> (maybe more - Dr. Emmerson often adjusts his treatment) written by the best weird fiction authors including <strong>H. P. Lovecraft</strong> and <strong>Stefan Grabi\u0144ski</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > dozens of <strong>interesting facts</strong> about the authors and their masterpieces hidden inside the game </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/extras/fac9db1af8ad4e093fc6eeb07176f7e1.webp?t=1770217453\" width=620 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/extras/f0d62c3e91bae5c2d43fce8cf93e3331.avif?t=1770217453\" width=620 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So relax and let Dr. Emmerson guide you through all the <strong>colors of dread</strong>. Don't be afraid, these are just stories, they can't hurt you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>?yeht naC</strong></i></h2>","backg